 "purpose": "The beta screen layout ('schermen 1.0') for Cijferen: an Oefenaar subclass that draws the question, tip and cheat sheet in bordered panels. Only active with LEERAVONTUUR_BETA=1.",
 "details": "BetaOefenaar overrides only _stel_vraag (for the grid and long-division answer types in INVOER_BETA; every other question goes to Oefenaar._stel_vraag through super()), so everything else (level, series, result, repeat bin, points) is the normal Oefenaar. Checking and storing follow the same steps as the normal code path for an input object (no second chance, answer stored through the Sessie). Drawing uses the layout rectangles of terminal/indeling.py and panel drawing of terminal/vak.py; the series line comes from kern/overzicht.py. oefenaar_klasse(domein) is how the curriculum chooses between the normal and the beta class. Per the father (22/11), Cijferen has no klad in the beta and the cheat sheet is always open.",
 "module_docstring": "Beta van de schermen 1.0 (werk/schermen.md): Cijferen in vakken, zoals btop. Alleen met LEERAVONTUUR_BETA=1.",
